  2| //!
  3| //! Always compiled. Every lane test runs against this, which is what keeps the
  4| //! test suite hermetic and fast — and, more importantly, what makes the
  5| //! noise-control rules testable: given a model that says exactly *this*, the
  6| //! filtering must post exactly *that*.
  7| //!
  8| //! It also records the requests it received, so a test can assert on prompt
  9| //! structure — including the cache-prefix discipline, which is otherwise
 10| //! invisible until a bill arrives.
